  "core_town_save_load.maybeLivingEncounter.001":'Tomas Vale',
  "core_town_save_load.maybeLivingEncounter.002":'Tomas Vale points out fresh braces and asks the Guardian to remember that every repaired section represents a crew working under threat.',
  "core_town_save_load.maybeLivingEncounter.003":'Mara Kest',
  "core_town_save_load.maybeLivingEncounter.004":'Mara Kest is organizing water, blankets, and runners so the square can empty quickly if the horns sound.',
  "core_town_save_load.maybeLivingEncounter.005":'Sergeant Orin',
  "core_town_save_load.maybeLivingEncounter.006":'Sergeant Orin is reorganizing squads around the defenders who have actually survived contact with the enemy.',
