  "hall_business_finance_logistics.showHomeBudget.003":(v0,v1,v2,v3,v4,v5,v6,v7,v8,v9,v10,v11)=>`<h2>Guardian Hall — Budget & Accounts</h2><p>Operating performance is tracked separately from Hall improvements and Guardian funding.</p><div class="budget-dashboard-grid"><div class="budget-kpi primary"><small>Hall Account Balance</small><b>${v0}g</b><span>available cash</span></div><div class="budget-kpi"><small>Guardian Gold</small><b>${v1}g</b><span>personal funds</span></div><div class="budget-kpi"><small>Lifetime Hall Income</small><b>${v2}g</b><span>earned by the Hall</span></div></div><div class="budget-period-grid">${v3}${v4}</div><h3>Fund the Hall</h3><div class="card budget-transfer-card"><input id="hallBudgetSlider" type="range" min="0" max="${v5}" step="1" value="${v6}" style="width:100%"><div class="stat-row"><span>Transfer from Guardian</span><b id="hallBudgetSliderValue">${v7} gold</b></div><button id="hallBudgetTransfer" ${v8}>Transfer Selected Gold</button></div><h3>Recurring Income Sources</h3><div class="budget-income-grid">${v9}</div>${v10}<div class="budget-toolbar"><button id="hallBudgetBusiness">Open Hall Business</button><button id="hallBudgetLogistics">Open Logistics</button></div><h3>Account Activity</h3><p class="muted compact">The detailed ledger is available when you need it, but it no longer dominates the budget screen.</p><button id="hallBudgetToggleLedger">Show Recent Transactions</button><div id="hallBudgetLedger" class="budget-ledger" hidden>${v11}</div><div class="dialog-footer"><button id="hallBudgetBack">Back</button></div>`,
