  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeAttemptMediation.006":'Guardian Hall mediation produces a workable agreement',
  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeAttemptMediation.007":(v0,v1,v2,v3)=>`Representatives of ${v0} and ${v1} leave with a narrower dispute and a workable understanding. Their relationship improves from ${v2} to ${v3}.`,
