  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeResolveSanctuaryAudience.002":'Guardian Hall cannot responsibly offer sanctuary without adequate food and household reserves.',
  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeResolveSanctuaryAudience.003":'Guardian Hall refuses a faction demand to surrender a sanctuary-seeker',
  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeResolveSanctuaryAudience.004":'Guardian Hall grants temporary sanctuary under its own authority',
  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeResolveSanctuaryAudience.005":`The Guardian grants temporary sanctuary and refuses to surrender the traveler solely on the delegation's demand. Hall guards are instructed that any removal requires the Guardian's consent.`,
  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeResolveSanctuaryAudience.006":'Guardian Hall negotiates a neutral transfer in a sanctuary dispute',
  "hall_life_visitors_diplomacy.homeResolveSanctuaryAudience.007":'You arrange a neutral handoff through Shantium civic authorities with written safeguards. Neither side gets everything it wanted, but the Hall avoids becoming a faction detention site.',
