  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.051":'Independent',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.052":'Redstone',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.053":'Raiders',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.054":'Outlaws',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.055":'Independent',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.056":'Spawn',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.057":'Raiders',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.058":'Outlaws',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.059":'The tree cover makes every sound carry differently out here.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.060":'A good scout can disappear ten steps off this trail.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.061":'Nobody stays clean in country like this.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.062":'The ground itself feels like it is deciding where we are allowed to walk.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.063":'Broken stone makes a good lookout and a bad place to twist an ankle.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.064":'Every ledge here looks like somebody once thought it was defensible.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.065":'Old fortifications make people talk about whoever had to hold them.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.066":'Ruins like this are full of decisions somebody had to make too quickly.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.067":'The river keeps half the region moving whether the councils agree or not.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.068":'You can tell a lot about the region by who is waiting for the ferry.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.069":'Stonebridge never really sleeps; somebody is always arriving with a price or leaving with a promise.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.070":'Too many roads meet here for secrets to stay private forever.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.071":'Northgate watches the roads because the roads watch Northgate back.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.072":'This place feels like it was built around reports arriving late.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.073":'Temporary camps become permanent habits faster than anyone admits.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.074":'People here know exactly how much of a home can fit in one wagon.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.075":'Redstone builds places that tell you where to stand before anyone says a word.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.076":'Even the silence here feels inspected.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.077":'Coming back here always changes the pace of the company.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.078":'Shantium has started to feel less like a destination and more like something we carry with us.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.079":'Every terrace solves a different problem until the whole city somehow works.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.080":'An unwalled city still has defenses; most of them are called geography.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.081":'A road closure is easy to announce and difficult to live beside.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.082":'You can tell how bad the pass is by how crowded the mule yards become.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.083":'Local paths matter because the main road is never the only road people actually use.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.084":'Stone, timber, and water become political questions when every resource sits on somebody’s slope.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.085":'The Domains look connected from a ridge and very separate once you start asking who owns what.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.086":'A valley can share a mill and still have six opinions about a bridge.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.087":'Everything here is either carrying weight or being asked to carry more.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.088":'Quarry work teaches respect for things that fail without caring who ordered them not to.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.089":'A watch this high survives on discipline, weather sense, and the next supply load actually arriving.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.090":'Signals are useful only if the right people understand them in time.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.091":'Sound and distance lie strangely in a gorge.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.092":'The creek chooses the easy route; people do not get that luxury.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.093":'Up here the weather is part of the road.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.094":'A pass does not care how urgent your schedule is.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.095":'Sengia is loud enough to make even official orders compete for attention.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.096":'A walled capital can look secure while depending on roads far beyond the walls.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.097":'You can smell resin and sawdust before the garrison comes into view.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.098":'Lockwood has the uneasy look of a place whose local council and occupying barracks both think they are the practical authority.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.099":'Every road report here comes with an older story about somebody who ignored one.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.100":'The northern route is longer, which is sometimes the same thing as safer.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.101":'It is easy to call a valley a food source when you are not the one saving seed grain.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.102":'The lake makes Briarlake look peaceful; the grain sheds explain why larger powers care about it.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.103":'People here notice whether an armed traveler asks before taking.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.104":'Glenbrook remembers supply requests by who paid, who promised, and who simply loaded the wagon.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.105":'A dry town counts water before enthusiasm.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.106":'Tyrdon can offer people more easily than provisions, and that difference matters.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.107":'The resin smell makes every open flame look more serious.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.108":'Workshops, stables, and the eastern road make this small town strategically larger than it looks.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.109":'The valley can feed armies, which is exactly why farmers here worry about armies.',
  "companions_life_road.showPersistentCompanion.110":'Mountain walls make the farms look protected until you remember how few roads carry the harvest out.',
  // -- recordGuardianStance --
